---
// The paper section: how I build.
const rules = [
  'Work in small, testable steps.',
  'No new dependencies without asking.',
  'Never weaken a security default.',
  'Each phase ends with a done test.',
];
---

<section id="how" class="paper" aria-labelledby="how-title">
  <div class="stack">
    <h2 id="how-title" class="headline statement">
      <span>I don't write most of the code.</span>
      <span class="statement-end">I write the <span class="emphasis">brief.</span></span>
    </h2>

    <div class="method">
      <p class="method-text">
        Every project starts with a document: who it's for, the rules the agent can't break, and a
        done test for each step. Then I direct Claude Code through it in pieces small enough to
        check. Most of the work is deciding what good looks like, then making it hard to get wrong.
      </p>
      <figure class="rules">
        <figcaption class="label rules-source">From firn / CLAUDE.md</figcaption>
        <ul class="rules-list">
          {rules.map((rule) => <li>{rule}</li>)}
        </ul>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .paper {
    position: relative;
    padding: 104px var(--gutter) 120px;
    color: var(--fg);
  }

  .stack {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 120px;
  }

  .statement {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 28px;
    font-size: clamp(44px, 6.4vw, 100px);
    line-height: 0.95;
    text-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .statement > span:first-child {
    max-width: 900px;
  }

  .statement-end {
    align-self: flex-end;
    text-align: right;
  }

  .method {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 32px 64px;
  }

  .method-text {
    flex: 1 1 360px;
    min-width: 0;
    max-width: 520px;
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 19px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--body);
  }

  .rules {
    flex: 0 1 420px;
    min-width: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
    margin: 0;
    padding-top: 4px;
  }

  .rules-source {
    padding-bottom: 6px;
    color: var(--fg-muted);
  }

  .rules-list {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .paper {
      padding-block: 72px 88px;
    }

    .stack {
      gap: 80px;
    }

    .method-text {
      font-size: 17px;
    }
  }
</style>
